OL,3,CThree people killed in shooting at
OL,4,CSeattle food festival as police hunt
OL,5,Csuspect
OL,7,FThree people have been killed and four
OL,8,Finjured after a shooting at a crowded
OL,9,Ffood festival in Seattle on Sunday.
OL,11,FPolice in the US say one suspect has
OL,12,Fbeen arrested, and they are searching
OL,13,Ffor another following the shooting
OL,14,Fnear the city's iconic Space Needle.
OL,16,FAssistant Chief Tyrone Davis said
OL,17,Fdetectives do not have any description
OL,18,Fof the outstanding suspect.
OL,19,FInvestigators believe the two were
OL,20,Fshooting at each other and there is no
OL,21,Fongoing threat to the public.
