OL,3,CThree people killed in shooting at
OL,4,CSeattle food festival as police hunt
OL,5,Csuspect
OL,7,FThe gunfire erupted around 6 pm in the
OL,8,Fwaning hours of the Bite of Seattle,
OL,9,Fan annual festival that draws hundreds
OL,10,Fof food and retail vendors and
OL,11,Fperformers.
OL,13,FThe injured are in a stable condition
OL,14,Fin hospital.
OL,16,FA two-year-old boy, a 23-year-old man
OL,17,Fand a 39-year-old woman are in stable
OL,18,Fcondition, while a 40-year-old woman
OL,19,Fhad minor injuries, she said.
